# A core-only desktop discovers and runs an independently installed Calculator.
wait 30
click 980 30
wait 8
menu-pick Utilities
wait 8
menu-pick Calculator
wait 100
expect-title Calculator
key 1
key 2
key +
key 3
key Return
wait 10
click 60 8
wait 8
expect-menu Copy result|Close
click 80 43
wait 30
expect-no-title Calculator
quit
